<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN CAR REGISTRATIONS UP 13.8 % IN YR TO AUG.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN CAR REGISTRATIONS UP 13.8 % IN YR TO AUG.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian new car registrations rose 13.8 percent in the year to August compared with the same year ago period, according to figures from the Belgian National Statistics Institute.</p>
<p>Registrations were down 9.8 percent in August from August 1995.</p>
<p>    BELGIAN CAR REGISTRATIONS  Aug 96	  Aug 95</p>
<p>    Month			   21,560	  23,899</p>
<p>    Cumulative Jan-Aug	 305,359	 268,383</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
